title: Benchmark Evaluation of Electronic Image Stabilization and De-rotation Gating
  in Monocular Visual Odometry
abstract: This repository provides a simulation-based benchmark evaluation of electronic
  image stabilization (EIS) and yaw-rate de-rotation gating in monocular visual odometry.
  Across 24 core matrix flight comparisons (n=3), EIS-GATED did not significantly
  improve trajectory accuracy over RAW, while a recoverPose depth-filter configuration
  failure under small baselines was identified and repaired.
